:: Octavia \[Event\] - Two Camps One Chief - Split Fight [bg-settlement]
<h1 class="ptitle">SETTLEMENT GATES</h1>
<br />
You send what you can spare after her — not enough to feel safe about it, but enough that she doesn't argue twice. Then you turn back to your own wall, already hearing movement in the dark beyond it.
<br /><br />
<center>
    <<image 'people/octavia/two_camps_split1.jpg'>>
</center>
<br />
Fewer of them on your side of the fence tonight, at least. Small mercies.
<br /><br />
<<link 'Hold what is left of the line'>>
    <<set $game.death_reason = 'overrun at the gate'>>
    <<generateEnemies 3>>
    <<set $fight.skipEnding = true>>
    <<fight $enemies 'Octavia [Event] - Two Camps One Chief - Aftermath' 'Dead'>>
<</link>>
